        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Joint Union-Company Oversight Committee shall consist of up to four (4) persons representing the Company and four (4) persons representing the Union. The Company representatives will be appointed from Business Unit and Human Resources management. The Union representatives will include three (3) employees and the Union's Executive Director or designee. Each party shall appoint a chairperson of its group.",
